---
layout: layouts/cms.njk
permalink: /cms/index.html
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
<main class="cms-shell" data-cms-root>
  <section class="cms-login" data-login-panel aria-labelledby="login-title">
    <a class="cms-brand" href="{{ '/' | url }}"><span class="cms-brand__mark">B</span><span><strong>Blogmoi</strong><small>Visual CMS</small></span></a>
    <div class="cms-login__card">
      <p class="eyebrow">Private editor · Git backed</p>
      <h1 id="login-title">Đăng nhập CMS</h1>
      <p>Nhập fine grained GitHub token có quyền Contents read/write trên <strong>blogco/blogmoi</strong>. Token chỉ nằm trong bộ nhớ trang và bị xóa khi tải lại hoặc đăng xuất.</p>
      <label for="github-token">GitHub Personal Access Token</label>
      <input id="github-token" type="password" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" placeholder="github_pat_…">
      <button class="button button--primary" type="button" data-login>Connect to GitHub</button>
      <p class="cms-status" role="status" aria-live="polite" data-login-status></p>
      <small>GitHub kiểm tra quyền ghi của token cho mỗi tài khoản trước khi mở trình soạn thảo. Không nhập token vào URL hoặc lưu trên thiết bị.</small>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="cms-app" data-app hidden>
    <header class="cms-topbar">
      <a class="cms-brand" href="{{ '/' | url }}"><span class="cms-brand__mark">B</span><span><strong>Blogmoi</strong><small>Visual CMS</small></span></a>
      <div class="cms-topbar__actions">
        <span class="cms-user" data-user-name></span>
        <button class="button button--quiet" type="button" data-preview>Preview</button>
        <button class="button button--quiet" type="button" data-save-draft>Save draft</button>
        <button class="button button--primary" type="button" data-publish>Publish</button>
        <button class="button button--quiet" type="button" data-logout>Log out</button>
      </div>
    </header>
    <div class="cms-workspace">
      <aside class="cms-sidebar" aria-label="CMS navigation">
        <button class="is-active" type="button" data-view="dashboard">Dashboard</button>
        <button type="button" data-view="posts">Posts <span data-post-count></span></button>
        <button type="button" data-new-post>New Post</button>
        <button type="button" data-view="drafts">Drafts <span data-draft-count></span></button>
        <button type="button" data-view="media">Media</button>
        <button type="button" data-view="settings">Settings</button>
        <p class="cms-sidebar__note">Changes publish as a normal repository commit. Local drafts never leave this browser.</p>
      </aside>
      <main class="cms-main">
        <section class="cms-view" data-page="dashboard">
          <div class="cms-page-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Editorial workspace</p><h1>Dashboard</h1></div><button class="button button--primary" type="button" data-new-post>Write a post</button></div>
          <div class="cms-stat-grid"><article><span>Published posts</span><strong data-dashboard-posts>—</strong></article><article><span>Local drafts</span><strong data-dashboard-drafts>—</strong></article><article><span>Repository</span><strong>blogco/blogmoi</strong></article></div>
          <h2>Recent posts</h2><div class="cms-post-list" data-recent-posts></div>
        </section>
        <section class="cms-view" data-page="posts" hidden>
          <div class="cms-page-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Repository</p><h1>Posts</h1></div><button class="button button--primary" type="button" data-new-post>New post</button></div>
          <label class="cms-search"><span class="sr-only">Search posts</span><input type="search" placeholder="Search by title, slug or tag…" data-post-search></label>
          <p class="cms-status" role="status" aria-live="polite" data-deployment-status></p>
          <div class="cms-post-list" data-post-list></div>
        </section>
        <section class="cms-view" data-page="drafts" hidden>
          <div class="cms-page-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">This browser only</p><h1>Drafts</h1></div><button class="button button--primary" type="button" data-new-post>New post</button></div>
          <p>Drafts are stored on this device in this browser. They are not sent to GitHub until you publish.</p><div class="cms-post-list" data-draft-list></div>
        </section>
        <section class="cms-view" data-page="media" hidden>
          <div class="cms-page-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Images</p><h1>Media</h1></div></div>
          <p>Select an existing post to manage its cover. Uploaded files are validated and committed under <code>static/uploads/</code>.</p>
          <div class="cms-post-list" data-media-list></div>
        </section>
        <section class="cms-view" data-page="settings" hidden>
          <div class="cms-page-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Configuration</p><h1>Settings</h1></div></div>
          <article class="cms-info-card"><h2>GitHub access</h2><p data-settings-user></p><p>Repository: <strong>blogco/blogmoi</strong>. Token is held in memory and cleared when you log out or reload.</p><p>Use a fine grained token restricted to this repository with Contents read/write. Add Actions read if you want to see build status from the CMS.</p></article>
          <article class="cms-info-card"><h2>Unsplash setup</h2><p data-unsplash-setup></p><p>Unsplash search uses a Cloudflare Worker proxy. The Access Key is stored as a Worker secret and never shipped to this page. Automatic Unsplash covers work without an API key. Configuring the proxy enables the optional full Unsplash search. Upload your own images into the article body, after the cover.</p></article>
        </section>
        <section class="cms-view cms-editor" data-page="editor" hidden>
          <div class="cms-page-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow" data-editor-state>New article</p><h1>Article editor</h1></div><div class="cms-heading-actions"><button class="button button--quiet" type="button" data-cancel-editor>Back</button><button class="button button--primary" type="button" data-publish>Publish</button></div></div>
          <div class="cms-editor-grid">
            <div class="cms-editor-main">
              <section class="cms-card cms-fields" aria-label="Article metadata">
                <label>Title<input type="text" data-field="title" maxlength="180"></label>
                <div class="cms-field-row"><label>Slug<input type="text" data-field="slug" autocomplete="off"></label><button class="button button--quiet" type="button" data-suggest-slug>Suggest</button></div>
                <label>Description<textarea rows="3" maxlength="260" data-field="description"></textarea><button class="button button--quiet" type="button" data-suggest-description>Suggest from article</button></label>
                <div class="cms-field-row"><label>Date<input type="date" data-field="date"></label><label>Category<input type="text" data-field="categories" placeholder="Công nghệ, Web Design"></label></div>
                <label>Tags<input type="text" data-field="tags" placeholder="Eleventy, Performance, Blogmoi"></label>
                <details><summary>SEO & editorial metadata</summary>
                  <label>SEO title<input type="text" data-field="seoTitle" maxlength="180"></label>
                  <label>SEO description<textarea rows="3" maxlength="260" data-field="seoDescription"></textarea></label>
                  <div class="cms-field-row"><label>Language<input type="text" data-field="lang" value="vi"></label><label>Author<input type="text" data-field="author" value="Blogmoi"></label></div>
                  <label>Key points <small>One editor reviewed item per line</small><textarea rows="5" data-field="keyPoints"></textarea></label>
                  <div class="cms-faq-heading"><strong>Q&A</strong><button class="button button--quiet" type="button" data-add-faq>Add Q&A</button></div><div data-faq-list></div>
                  <label>Original author<input type="text" data-field="originalAuthor"></label>
                  <label>Source publisher<input type="text" data-field="sourcePublisher"></label>
                  <label>Source URL<input type="url" data-field="sourceUrl"></label>
                  <div class="cms-field-row"><label>Source publication date<input type="date" data-field="sourcePublicationDate"></label><label>Copyright holder<input type="text" data-field="copyrightHolder"></label></div>
                  <label>Editorial note<textarea rows="2" data-field="editorialNote"></textarea></label>
                  <label>Copyright notice<textarea rows="2" data-field="copyrightNotice"></textarea></label>
                  <label>Dictionary terms<input type="text" data-field="dictionaryTerms" placeholder="Optional comma separated terms"></label>
                </details>
              </section>
              <section class="cms-card cms-cover" aria-labelledby="cover-title">
                <div class="cms-card-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">16:9 cover</p><h2 id="cover-title">Article thumbnail</h2></div><span data-cover-state></span></div>
                <div class="cms-cover-preview" data-cover-preview><span>No cover selected</span></div>
                <p class="cms-attribution" data-cover-attribution></p>
                <label class="cms-cover-source"><input type="radio" name="cover-source" value="unsplash" checked disabled data-cover-source> Chọn ảnh từ Unsplash — ảnh đầu tiên</label>
                <p>Ảnh đầu tiên luôn là ảnh bìa Unsplash. Từ ảnh thứ hai, dùng nút tải ảnh trong nội dung bên dưới.</p>
                <label>Unsplash cover URL<input type="url" data-field="cover" readonly placeholder="Automatic Unsplash cover"></label>
                <label>Alt text<input type="text" data-field="coverAlt"></label>
                <div class="cms-cover-actions"><button class="button button--quiet" type="button" data-auto-suggest>Auto suggest</button><button class="button button--quiet" type="button" data-random>Random</button><button class="button button--quiet" type="button" data-open-search>Search Unsplash</button><button class="button button--quiet" type="button" data-open-search>Replace</button></div>
                <p class="cms-status" role="status" aria-live="polite" data-unsplash-status></p>
                <div class="cms-unsplash" data-unsplash-panel hidden>
                  <form data-unsplash-form><label>Search Unsplash<input type="search" minlength="2" placeholder="technology, travel, coffee…" data-unsplash-query></label><button class="button button--primary" type="submit">Search</button></form>
                  <div class="cms-photo-grid" data-photo-grid></div>
                  <div class="cms-selected-photo" data-selected-photo hidden></div>
                  <button class="button button--primary" type="button" data-use-photo disabled>Use selected image</button>
                </div>
              </section>
              <section class="cms-card cms-content-card">
                <div class="cms-card-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Visual editor</p><h2>Article content</h2></div><div class="cms-content-stats"><span data-word-count>0 words</span><span data-reading-time>1 min read</span></div></div>
                <div class="cms-toolbar" role="toolbar" aria-label="Article formatting">
                  <button type="button" data-command="bold" aria-label="Bold"><strong>B</strong></button><button type="button" data-block="h2">H2</button><button type="button" data-block="h3">H3</button><button type="button" data-command="italic" aria-label="Italic"><em>I</em></button><button type="button" data-command="insertUnorderedList" aria-label="Bulleted list">• List</button><button type="button" data-command="insertOrderedList" aria-label="Numbered list">1. List</button><button type="button" data-command="formatBlock" data-value="blockquote">Quote</button><button type="button" data-insert-link>Link</button><button type="button" data-insert-image>Image URL</button><button type="button" data-upload-image>Tải ảnh nội dung (ảnh 2+)</button><input type="file" accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp,image/avif" multiple hidden data-image-file><button type="button" data-insert-table>Table</button><button type="button" data-insert-code>Code</button></div>
                <div class="cms-content-split">
                  <div class="cms-edit-column"><label for="article-body">Write article</label><div id="article-body" class="cms-visual-editor" contenteditable="true" role="textbox" aria-multiline="true" data-article-body></div><small>Text is stored as Markdown. Tables, code, Unicode and links are preserved when you save.</small></div>
                  <div class="cms-preview-column"><label for="article-preview">Live Blogmoi preview</label><iframe id="article-preview" title="Actual Blogmoi article design preview" src="{{ '/benchmark-eleventy-hugo-astro-cung-bo-noi-dung/' | url }}" data-preview-frame></iframe></div>
                </div>
              </section>
              <section class="cms-card cms-validation" data-validation></section>
            </div>
            <aside class="cms-editor-side"><section class="cms-card cms-seo-card"><p class="eyebrow">Google search preview</p><div data-seo-preview><strong data-seo-title>Article title</strong><span>blogco.github.io/blogmoi/<b data-seo-slug>slug</b>/</span><p data-seo-description>Article description</p></div><p data-related-posts></p></section><button class="button button--quiet" type="button" data-save-draft>Save draft</button><button class="button button--primary" type="button" data-publish>Publish article</button><p class="cms-status" role="status" aria-live="polite" data-publish-status></p></aside>
          </div>
        </section>
      </main>
    </div>
    <div class="cms-toast" role="status" aria-live="polite" data-toast hidden></div>
  </div>
</main>
